s join Middle East conflict</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/mar/29/middle-east-crisis-live-explosions-tehran-yemen-houthis-iran-war-updates-trump-us-israel-strikes-lebanon'>Middle East crisis live: Explosions in Tehran as Yemen’s Houthis heighten risks of Iran war</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/houthi-missile-attack-israel-stokes-fears-renewed-red-131505922'>A Houthi missile attack on Israel stokes fears of renewed Red Sea shipping strikes</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/03/28/world/iran-war-trump-israel-oil'>U.S. Marines Arrive in Middle East, as Houthis Enter War</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/israeli-military-says-it-identified-launch-missile-yemen-2026-03-28/'>The Houthis launch a ballistic missile from Yemen towards Israel, signifying the group&#x27;s entrance in the war. The Israeli military says that the missile was successfully intercepted and no injuries were reported. (Reuters)</a> - reuters.com</li></ul>